    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Andre Remillard",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101313581857939457366/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocISk2fqqSD93U5xcqv0UKR21tHNr9NBnbaCiCMQKntn99KoeQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Went and bought a 3/4-in pressure release valve. Found out they charged me twice the price of where I could have bought it anywhere else. I don't think I will ever go back to that plumbing supply store. I could imagine how many other people they did the same thing",
        "time": 1729444006,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Proprio",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102391720495154635944/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUMLSJx9_bPPW5d8MAN4-oboM8_fmn5Vz44WcGyV2PFKn-yUKBR=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "This outlet can’t get their story straight and appear to be colluding with specific contractors.\n\nI don’t have an account at Wolseley but needed a replacement part for a system that came from them, so I called. They said it would be no problem selling the part to me. They referred me to their specialist who looked up the part number. I confirmed availability and price, and drove to the Vaudreuil outlet to purchase it. When I arrived, I was greeted by Etienne Bercier. Étienne refused to sell the part to me. He insisted they only sell that part to customers with accounts and recommended a specific contractor.\n\nI ordered the replacement part through a plumbing store with a Wolseley account, 5 minutes away. They agreed to  place the order and would call me back for payment. Wolseley refused to sell the part to them!!! The store told me to contact the same person that Etienne told me to contact 10 minutes earlier.\n\nI went back in to confront Etienne who denied having received a call from the store and denied refusing to sell the part to the store. Etienne pulled in his director who backed up his story about not being able to sell the part to me nor a store without a specific RBQ license.\n\nI called another Wolseley outlet: they had no problem selling the replacement part to me directly, a part that can be purchased on Amazon for half the price (if you can wait for shipping).",
        "time": 1667748171,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jay Weiss",
